			"Message": "chore(Land): Synchronize submodules and streamline build documentation\n\nUpdate `Dependency` to `05f4386` (VS Code 0a610158) to integrate Agent Host Phase 9 stability fixes, including subprocess crash recovery and terminal trust checks. Update `Element` to `a41d6f7` to remove obsolete build instructions referencing legacy recursive cloning workflows, aligning documentation with the current independent submodule architecture.\n\nRefactor `Maintain/Format.sh` and `Maintain/Format/*.py` to standardize punctuation usage (replacing en-dashes with hyphens) and update comments to correctly reflect code generation paths. Extend `.prettierignore` and the shell formatter to exclude `**/bin/` generated executables and companion scripts. Consolidate root `README.md` references to point toward `Documentation/GitHub/Building.md`, reducing duplication and maintaining a cleaner repository overview.",
			"SHA": "58dd02634f769c23ee2870dbc6e7b8065b73ad90"
